  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tGeneral\n\n### How to Change your Password\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 15 Aug, 2024 at 12:30 PM\n\nThe article below will guide you on how to change your password.\n\nVideo 1 Existing Ecosystem\n\nVideo 2 New Ecosystem\n\nNavigate: My Admin > Person Icon (Top Right corner) > Profile Settings\n\nOnce you have clicked on the Person Icon located in the top right corner of the screen, please click ' Profile Settings ' form the drop down list.\n\nThen you will be asked to updated your password.\n\nNote: The password must contain the below criteria\n\n - 12 - 32 Characters\n - 1 Number\n - 1 upper case letter\n - 1 lower case letter\n - Special character\n\nMust NOT contain more than 2 identical characters in a row and do NOT include blank spaces.\n\nCongratulations! You've have successfully updated your password. If you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your account manager.\n\nhttps://www.loom.com/share/3fc43912850f4472bb1e65d75a6625a6\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000092543\">General</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000189872\">General</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to Change your Password\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 15 Aug, 2024 at 12:30 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/dc214c1b20ab47cf867c2cfdaddebb32\"></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The article below will guide you on how to change your password.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/dc214c1b20ab47cf867c2cfdaddebb32\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Video 1 Existing Ecosystem</span></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/3fc43912850f4472bb1e65d75a6625a6\">Video 2 New Ecosystem</a></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigate:&nbsp;</strong>My Admin &gt; Person Icon (Top Right corner) &gt; Profile Settings</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once you have clicked on the Person Icon located in the top right corner of the screen, please click <strong>' Profile Settings&nbsp;</strong>' form the drop down list.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9216719479/original/00tYXFLUdhD1MJjCLOCGPkFULcu3fHu8zQ.png?1723720945\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216719479\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Then you will be asked to updated your password.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9216719580/original/mQzpcfHG4i6oBmYW7sC4rJbEXgrJV5OzmQ.png?1723721134\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216719580\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Note: The password must contain the below criteria</strong></span></p><ul><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">12 - 32 Characters</span></li><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1 Number</span></li><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1 upper case letter</span></li><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1 lower case letter</span></li><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Special character</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Must NOT contain more than 2 identical characters in a row and do NOT include blank spaces.<br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Congratulations! You've have successfully updated your password. If you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your account manager.</span></strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/3fc43912850f4472bb1e65d75a6625a6\">https://www.loom.com/share/3fc43912850f4472bb1e65d75a6625a6</a></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000234321\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000234321/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000234321\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000234321/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000234321\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language